### Page 331 of 432

```text
Roadway Classifications
Principal Arterial – High speeds and long,
uninterrupted travel
Minor Arterial – Slower speeds than principal
arterial, often provides connections to
principal arterials
Major and Minor Collectors – Collects traffic
from local roads and distributes to arterials
Local Street – Provides access to land, little
or no through traffic
```

### Page 332 of 432

