UDC has two standard options for a
Minor Arterial Roadway
Provide regional continuity and accommodate
moderate speeds and volumes
Traffic volumes
7,500 – 18,000 for 2-lane
15,000 – 32,000 for 4-lane
Speed Limits 35-40 MPH
Right-of-Way: 100’
```

